# Events gate audit — before venue / Cycle promotion

**Todo:** [`tasks/events/todo.md`](../../../tasks/events/todo.md)  
**Pre-verify (before code):** [`mdeai-events-pre-impl-verify.mdc`](./mdeai-events-pre-impl-verify.mdc)  
**Changelog:** [`tasks/events/changelog.md`](../../../tasks/events/changelog.md)

## When to run

- Before assigning **SAN-492–496** to Cycle 1
- Before starting **Phase B** venue implementation
- After any agent claims "gate cleared"

## Phase A exit checklist (all must PASS)

| # | Check | How to verify |
|---|-------|----------------|
| 1 | **SAN-731 · UI-004** merged on `main` | `git log main --oneline \| grep -i 731` + Linear Done |
| 2 | **SAN-135 · AIE-024** merged on `main` | `git log main --oneline \| grep -i 135` + Linear Done |
| 3 | **Changelog** updated | Rows in `tasks/events/changelog.md` for 731 + 135 |
| 4 | **Evidence** exists | `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-731-*` and SAN-135 |
| 5 | **Linear Done** | User approved (not agent-only In Review) |
| 6 | **Blockers** updated | e.g. SAN-729 unblocked by SAN-730 Done |

**If any check fails → stop.** Next task remains Phase A (731 or 135), not venue.

## Blocker chain verification (Phase B)

Confirm via Linear MCP `get_issue` + `includeRelations: true`:

```text
SAN-492 · EVT-033 — Event venue + offerings schema
  ↓
SAN-493 · EVT-034 — Seed Mamacita + 5 event partners
  ↓
SAN-510 · EVT-051 + SAN-511 · EVT-052
  ↓
SAN-494 · EVT-035 — Restaurant card Event Venue CTA
  ↓
SAN-495 · EVT-036 — Event offerings detail panel
  ↓
SAN-496 · EVT-037 — Request proposal modal (HITL)
```

## Cycle 1 assignment rule

**Do not** assign B.1–B.7 to Cycle 1 while SAN-731 or SAN-135 are not merged.

**After gate passes only**, assign in order:

SAN-492 → SAN-493 → SAN-510 → SAN-511 → SAN-494 → SAN-495 → SAN-496

